      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... the 'adjusting' part feels impossible. it's like i'm speaking a language no one understands. and the more i try to bridge the gap, the more i realize there is no bridge. it's just a constant, heavy weight. sometimes i just wish i could stop fighting it. like just... stop.",
