      "content": "That weight you're carrying—it's not a sign you're broken, it's proof you've been fighting a battle no one else can see. And \"stopping\" doesn't have to mean giving up; it can mean putting the fight down for a moment and letting yourself just exist without the pressure to connect. You don't have to build a bridge to everyone—maybe just find one person who speaks your silence. And if that feels impossible too, then let yourself be the one who understands you, even if it's just for today.",
